; ---- lane E L-b (step 5, STEP5_PLAN 10): OPTIONS, one screen (the PC SETTINGS host screen, its GAME tab first) ----
; fe.OpenOptions(defBtn): the MAIN MENU's OPTIONS row. The game's own options as its getters return them go to the
; host first (fscommand SR_GameOptionsLive, kernel/game_options.hpp: the GAME tab shows them), then the open
; request (kernel/display_menu.cpp hands "display" to the OPTIONS overlay); the menu comes back under it with
; OPTIONS focused.
